  "edits": [
    {
      "id": "A25469-zh-00001",
      "text": "■《智慧城市建设及产业振兴等相关法律施行规则》〔附页第5号之3格式〕<2021年7月12日新增>",
      "source_hash": "4a94642cf8d48a63167b6f04f93d9bd420b795a1df917d782e0e9e37b7dff71f",
      "target_id": "XML:1802856"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25469-zh-00002",
      "text": "规制快速确认结果通知书",
      "source_hash": "8e123d73d6178fc706f11a862f2db28b07cde5f0bd0bb77e1c7c103029168d28",
      "target_id": "XML:1802857"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25469-zh-00004",
      "text": "法人名称（姓名）",
      "source_hash": "9444b0a00a812f655b27d369eb4c26c19b67484b28bc7411ca01f82e11d76532",
      "target_id": "XML:1802859"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25469-zh-00005",
      "text": "营业（法人）登记号码",
      "source_hash": "7e53d842dd0fd3a5f45f9a5162eb0ddefccb0e462c2c1c38b1e4f0d5a81dd547",
      "target_id": "XML:1802860"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25469-zh-00008",
      "text": "代表人",
      "source_hash": "7bdbbfa1a6f2c065dc71d6c5479f207830048667134efede03f4a3beb9b42c68",
      "target_id": "XML:1802863"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25469-zh-00011",
      "text": "规制快速确认",
      "source_hash": "d8e098d2ba328826c94dff188011811c8bf8c29034796d2138be5d7a96ed684f",
      "target_id": "XML:1802866"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25469-zh-00012",
      "text": "1. 需要国土交通部长官或主管行政机关负责人办理许可、批准、认证、验证、认可、",
      "source_hash": "47b9cbc2fd209e6cea9ab5fd131d05300d3b13886a6daa4da115c85b23b58100",
      "target_id": "XML:1802867"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25469-zh-00014",
      "text": "登记等手续",
      "source_hash": "94b2cde7f3c06a64b48cebaf9f98f31f74a51afbea231127e01752601a583f19",
      "target_id": "XML:1802869"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25469-zh-00015",
      "text": "※ 应附上主管行政机关负责人回复的办理许可、批准、认证、验证、认可、登记等所需的条件",
      "source_hash": "ae5353a406a5d5660a9793da521c59ccb08269e979aeec7ae575ae9157267a88",
      "target_id": "XML:1802870"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25469-zh-00016",
      "text": "和程序等资料（包括有关法令）",
      "source_hash": "7c45461b108558a1907f748d305e7ecd77c1d688e0650a514b121728c29f779c",
      "target_id": "XML:1802871"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25469-zh-00017",
      "text": "2. 不需要国土交通部长官或主管行政机关负责人办理许可、批准、认证、验证、认可、",
      "source_hash": "bccff45bcfd5a44a8f867d481b5f69eb5bb36137a0c099a9d220966801d7ac8a",
      "target_id": "XML:1802872"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25469-zh-00018",
      "text": "登记等手续",
      "source_hash": "01a009b6e766afd5c3a1e48d330d141d8288dd1d003fe49a5b8e7b24172b224d",
      "target_id": "XML:1802873"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25469-zh-00021",
      "text": "依据《智慧城市建设及产业振兴等相关法律》第四十九条之二、该法施行令第五十二条之二第二款及该法施行规则",
      "source_hash": "cec8e5e778c20ef3d4a0ad3296295ef00a33233537931fc5dbd32af5eb5f90d0",
      "target_id": "XML:1802876"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25469-zh-00022",
      "text": "第四条之二第二款，现将智慧创新技术及服务的规制快速确认结果通知如下。",
      "source_hash": "87a2ba4912887216615d79049c337735b3de1d03344d4f8ed9431e617119d1a3",
      "target_id": "XML:1802877"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25469-zh-00026",
      "text": "国土交通部长官",
      "source_hash": "5d198bb5e838918707a8044806bdf8567e7d1a9dde69dc6d15d873ed679d8657",
      "target_id": "XML:1802881"
    }
  ],
